INSERT INTO `chat_messages` VALUES (1,1,'user','I have weak nails, what do you recommend?',NULL,'2026-09-23 07:27:09.284'),(2,1,'bot','For clients looking to improve the condition of their nails, we offer several services that can help strengthen and protect them. \n\nWe recommend starting with our Signature Manicure (No Polish) to clean and groom your nails, or our Soft BIAB (Full Set), which is a popular treatment for strengthening natural nails. \n\nIf you are a new client, I highly recommend our Consultation First service (₱0, 15 minutes). This allows our professionals to assess your nail health and provide a personalized plan to help them grow stronger and healthier.\n\nYou can view our full list of nail care services, including various spa treatments and extensions, in our menu. Please let me know if you would like to book an appointment!\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-23 07:27:13.457'),(3,2,'user','Acne',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:14:41.331'),(4,2,'bot','For acne and breakouts, our top recommendations are:\n\n1. Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249): A 60-minute facial focused on clearing your pores.\n2. Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549): A 75-minute treatment tailored for more persistent breakouts.\n3. Signature DermaClear+ Clinical O2 AcneClear with Anti-Aging (₱2,999): A 90-minute intensive treatment for deep cleansing and rejuvenation.\n\nFor new clients, we highly recommend our Consultation First service, which is absolutely FREE. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. Would you like to know more about any of these treatments?',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:14:44.737'),(5,3,'user','carbon laser',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:14:44.855'),(6,3,'bot','We offer several Carbon Laser services at Souvari Skin Lab:\n\n1. Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (Face): Great for rejuvenating the skin and improving texture (₱1,499, 45 mins).\n2. Underarms – Carbon Laser Whitening: Specifically targets brightening and skin tone in the underarm area (₱799, 30 mins).\n3. Neck / Nape – Carbon Laser Whitening: Focused treatment for whitening the neck or nape area (₱1,050, 30 mins).\n\nIf you are a new client, I highly recommend booking our Consultation First service, which is completely free, so our experts can assess your needs. Would you like to know more about any of these options?\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:14:46.824'),(7,4,'user','Acne',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:21.883'),(8,4,'bot','For acne and blemishes, here are my top picks:\n\n- Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249, 60 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549, 75 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- 7 Sess. - Bikini Area Carbon Laser Whitening (₱7,134, 60 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n\nWant details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:22.021'),(9,5,'user','carbon laser',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:22.120'),(10,5,'bot','I can help you with:\n- Information about our services and treatments\n- Service pricing and packages\n- Our best-selling and recommended services\n- Clinic hours, location, and contact details\n- Booking or rescheduling appointments\n\nWhat would you like to know?',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:22.160'),(11,6,'user','recommend something for me',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:22.250'),(12,6,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, location, and appointments. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments, pricing, or booking, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:15:22.283'),(13,7,'user','Acne',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.667'),(14,7,'bot','Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask:\n- Price: ₱1,249\n- Duration: 60 minutes\n- Category: facial\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.733'),(15,8,'user','carbon laser',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.804'),(16,8,'bot','Knees – Carbon Laser Whitening:\n- Price: ₱1,199\n- Duration: 30 minutes\n- Category: body\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.839'),(17,9,'user','recommend something for me',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.921'),(18,9,'bot','I would love to recommend the right treatment for you. Could you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body?\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Consultation First (Recommended for New Clients)\" and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:20:17.959'),(19,10,'user','Acne',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.588'),(20,10,'bot','For acne and blemishes, here are my top picks:\n\n- Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249, 60 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549, 75 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- 7 Sess. - Elbow Carbon Laser Whitening (₱4,754, 60 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n\nWant details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.682'),(21,11,'user','carbon laser',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.759'),(22,11,'bot','Elbows – Carbon Laser Whitening:\n- Price: ₱799\n- Duration: 30 minutes\n- Category: body\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.789'),(23,12,'user','recommend something for me',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.880'),(24,12,'bot','I would love to recommend the right treatment for you. Could you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body?\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Consultation First (Recommended for New Clients)\" and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:23:53.921'),(25,13,'user