ask (₱1,249, 60 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549, 75 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n- Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (Face) (₱1,499, 45 min) — Ideal for acne and blemishes\n\nWant details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.573'),(55,22,'user','carbon laser',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.665'),(56,22,'bot','Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (Face):\n- Price: ₱1,499\n- Duration: 45 minutes\n- Category: laser\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.699'),(57,23,'user','do you offer botox',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.798'),(58,23,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Consultation First (Recommended for New Clients)\" and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.850'),(59,24,'user','i have dark spots',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.942'),(60,24,'bot','Here are my top recommendations for you:\n\n- Vitamin C Boost (10,000 mg) - High Dose Immunity (₱1,799, 10 min) — Ideal for dark spots and pigmentation\n- Vitamin C Boost (500 mg) (₱500, 10 min) — Ideal for dark spots and pigmentation\n- Full Lips Pigmentation (₱9,299, 90 min) — Ideal for dark spots and pigmentation\n\nWant details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:33.994'),(61,25,'user','recommend something for me',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:34.079'),(62,25,'bot','I would love to recommend the right treatment for you. Could you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body?\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Consultation First (Recommended for New Clients)\" and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-09-26 16:28:34.138'),(63,26,'user','services',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:44:59.998'),(64,26,'bot','I would love to help you find the right treatment! Could you please tell me your main skin concern or goal (e.g., acne, dark spots, wrinkles, hair removal, or relaxation) and whether it is for your face or body?',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:45:11.039'),(65,27,'user','nails',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:45:20.059'),(66,27,'bot','We offer a variety of nail services to keep your hands and feet looking their best. Options include our Luxe UV Gel Manicure for ₱499 or our Ultimate Luxe Hand Spa for ₱599 for a more pampering experience. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:45:28.197'),(67,28,'user','botox',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:45:44.174'),(68,28,'bot','Botox relaxes fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother, fresher look — we also offer dermal fillers and non-injectable lifting options.\n\n1) Signature Botox: Per Unit (₱450, 15 min)\n2) Signature Botox: Perioral (Lip Flip) (₱3,500, 15 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-09-28 16:45:47.913'),(69,29,'user','Products',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:16:21.183'),(70,29,'bot','I could not find a product matching that in our current catalog, so I do not want to guess at its details. You can browse what we carry by asking what products we have, or contact the clinic and our staff will check for you.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:16:21.260'),(71,30,'user','What products do you offer?',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:16:39.271'),(72,30,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:16:39.397'),(73,31,'user','What is Hydrating serum?',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:20:07.298'),(74,31,'bot','Hydrating Serum\nCategory: Skincare Products\nWe currently list this product by name and price only — fuller details are not on file yet.\nPrice: ₱1,800 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-03 15:20:07.396'),(75,32,'user','What services do you offer for acne?',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:03:51.496'),(76,32,'bot','For acne and breakouts, we offer: \n1) Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249) — targets breakouts with a soothing mask.\n2) Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549) — intensive care for more persistent concerns.\n3) Signature DermaClear+ Clinical O2 AcneClear with Anti-Aging (₱2,999) — a comprehensive facial for deep cleansing and rejuvenation.\n\nWould you like more details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:04:06.902'),(77,33,'user','What services do you offer for acne?',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:12:05.489'),(78,33,'bot','For acne concerns, we offer several effective treatments to help clear your skin:\n\n1. Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249): A 60-minute facial designed to soothe and treat mild breakouts.\n2. Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549): A 75-minute session focused on managing more persistent acne.\n3. Signature DermaClear+ Clinical O2 AcneClear with Anti-Aging (₱2,999): A 90-minute comprehensive treatment for acne-prone skin with anti-aging benefits.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. I also recommend our \"Free Skin Consultation\" to build the best plan for your needs!',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:12:31.489'),(79,34,'user','services',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:27:07.300'),(80,34,'bot','I could not find a product matching that in our current catalog, so I do not want to guess at its details. You can browse what we carry by asking what products we have, or contact the clinic and our staff will check for you.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:27:07.367'),(81,35,'user','Products',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:31:01.152'),(82,35,'bot','I could not find a product matching that in our current catalog, so I do not want to guess at its details. You can browse what we carry by asking what products we have, or contact the clinic and our staff will check for you.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 10:31:01.226'),(83,36,'user','services',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:08:56.908'),(84,36,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:08:57.026'),(85,37,'user','menu',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:08:57.162'),(86,37,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:08:57.233'),(87,38,'user','hours',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:08:57.296'),(88,38,'bot','Our clinic hours are:\nMonday-Saturday: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM, Sunday: Closed\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:00.469'),(89,39,'user','price',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:00.537'),(90,39,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nWhich service or category would you like pricing for?',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:03.427'),(91,40,'user','contact',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:03.481'),(92,40,'bot','Contact Information:\nPhone: +63 917 123 4567\nAddress: 123 Beauty Ave, Makati City, Metro Manila, Philippines\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:06.106'),(93,41,'user','book',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:06.179'),(94,41,'bot','Appointments are made through the website\'s booking page or by contacting the clinic directly. I can help with questions about our services, pricing, hours, and recommendations — what would you like to know?\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:08.926'),(95,42,'user','facial',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:09.007'),(96,42,'bot','Facial Cleansing Gel\nCategory: Skincare Products\nDescription: A gel-based facial cleanser that lathers with water to wash away daily buildup from the skin.\nPurpose: Used morning and/or evening to cleanse the face by lifting away dirt, excess oil, makeup and other impurities without leaving the skin feeling stripped.\nBenefits: Commonly used to leave skin clean and refreshed while helping maintain the skin’s moisture balance. Gentle enough for regular daily use.\nPrice: ₱850 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:09.055'),(97,43,'user','laser',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:09.114'),(98,43,'bot','Our lasers treat skin rejuvenation, pigmentation, stubborn acne marks, and unwanted hair across the face and body.\n\n1) Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (Face) (₱1,499, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:11.746'),(99,44,'user','acne',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:11.800'),(100,44,'bot','Acne Treatment Cream\nCategory: Skincare Products\nDescription: An over-the-counter topical cream formulated to help treat mild to moderate acne and blemishes. It is applied directly to the affected areas as part of a daily skincare routine.\nPurpose: Used to help clear up acne pimples and blemishes and to help prevent new ones from forming, by reducing acne-causing bacteria and helping to unclog pores.\nBenefits: Commonly used to reduce the number and appearance of pimples and blemishes, calm inflammation, and support clearer-looking skin with consistent use. Results typically take several weeks.\nPrice: ₱1,200 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:11.843'),(101,45,'user','membership',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:11.898'),(102,45,'bot','We offer VIP memberships with exclusive discounts and perks.\n\nAsk me for the specific options and I’ll help you choose.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:14.554'),(103,46,'user','waxing',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:14.604'),(104,46,'bot','Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing)\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A concentrated aftercare spot solution designed for use on the skin after hair removal such as waxing, to help manage post-wax bumps and ingrown hairs.\nPurpose: Used after waxing or other hair removal to help prevent and calm ingrown hairs, redness and small bumps on the treated area.\nBenefits: Commonly used to help reduce the appearance of post-wax bumps and redness, soothe irritated skin, and support smoother-looking skin when used regularly after hair removal.\nPrice: ₱250 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:14.642'),(105,47,'user','manicure',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:14.736'),(106,47,'bot','Our manicures keep hands polished and nails healthy — from classic care to UV gel finishes.\n\n1) Luxe UV Gel Manicure (₱499, 60 min)\n2) Signature Manicure (No polish) (₱129, 30 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:17.593'),(107,48,'user','biab',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:17.655'),(108,48,'bot','Soft BIAB builds a breathable, natural-looking structure that strengthens and shapes your nails.\n\n1) Soft BIAB (Full Set) (₱799, 60 min)\n2) Soft BIAB Removal (Souvari Work) (₱350, 20 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:20.238'),(109,49,'user','lash lift',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:20.295'),(110,49,'bot','Eyelash extensions and keratin lash lifts add instant length and curl with no mascara needed.\n\n1) Hybrid Eyelash Extension (₱1,249, 120 min)\n2) Classic Eyelash Extension (₱849, 120 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:23.015'),(111,50,'user','microblading',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:23.073'),(112,50,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:23.119'),(113,51,'user','pmu',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:23.177'),(114,51,'bot','Permanent makeup gives long-lasting brow, lash-line, and lip color — with professional touch-ups and tattoo removal.\n\n1) Eyebrow Design (₱369, 10 min)\n2) MicroWispy Brows (₱9,199, 90 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:25.813'),(115,52,'user','hifu',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:25.872'),(116,52,'bot','HIFU uses focused ultrasound to lift and tighten the face and neck without surgery or downtime.\n\n1) Eye Area HIFU (₱2,990, 30 min)\n2) Double Chin HIFU (₱3,290, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:28.648'),(117,53,'user','rf',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:28.707'),(118,53,'bot','Radio-frequency (RF) treatments tighten and firm the skin and body, with a non-invasive lift.\n\n1) Eye Area HIFU (₱2,990, 30 min)\n2) Neck Contouring (₱3,390, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:31.462'),(119,54,'user','rejuran',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:31.526'),(120,54,'bot','Rejuran skin boosters deliver rejuvenating polynucleotides to repair, hydrate, and revive tired skin.\n\n1) Rejuran I (Rejuran Eye) (₱25,000, 60 min)\n2) Rejuran S (Rejuran Scar) (₱25,000, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.196'),(121,55,'user','vitamin c',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.244'),(122,55,'bot','Vitamin C Serum\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A topical serum containing vitamin C (usually L-ascorbic acid), a well-studied antioxidant used in brightening and anti-ageing routines.\nPurpose: Used on the skin to provide antioxidant protection against environmental stress and to help brighten and even out the look of the complexion.\nBenefits: Commonly used to help brighten dull skin, even out skin tone and the look of dark spots, and support the skin’s collagen. It can be used alongside sunscreen; start gradually if the skin is sensitive.\nPrice: ₱1,600 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.290'),(123,56,'user','sunscreen',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.343'),(124,56,'bot','Sunscreen SPF50+\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A broad-spectrum sunscreen with SPF 50+, formulated to be applied to the skin before sun exposure and reapplied as directed.\nPurpose: Used to help protect the skin from UVA and UVB radiation, which helps prevent sunburn and reduce the risk of early skin ageing and sun-related skin damage.\nBenefits: Commonly used to help prevent sunburn and protect against sun-related skin ageing when applied as directed. Reapply at least every two hours, and after swimming, sweating or towel drying.\nPrice: ₱1,500 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.387'),(125,57,'user','retinol',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.456'),(126,57,'bot','Retinol Night Cream\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A night cream containing retinol, a vitamin A derivative widely used in anti-ageing and blemish-prone skincare. It is applied in the evening.\nPurpose: Used overnight to support the skin’s natural cell renewal and to help improve the look of fine lines, uneven texture, dark spots and clogged pores.\nBenefits: Commonly used to smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin texture and tone, and help unclog pores over several weeks of use. Skin can become more sun-sensitive, so daytime sunscreen is important.\nPrice: ₱1,400 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.504'),(127,58,'user','botox',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:34.574'),(128,58,'bot','Botox relaxes fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother, fresher look — we also offer dermal fillers and non-injectable lifting options.\n\n1) Signature Botox: Per Unit (₱450, 15 min)\n2) Signature Botox: Perioral (Lip Flip) (₱3,500, 15 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:37.210'),(129,59,'user','peel',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:37.264'),(130,59,'bot','Chemical peels exfoliate and renew the skin to fade pigmentation and smooth texture.\n\n1) 7 Sess. - Underarm Diamond Peel w/ Bleach (₱7,134, 60 min)\n2) Underarm Diamond Peel + Carbon Laser Whitening (₱1,499, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:39.907'),(131,60,'user','hair removal',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:39.985'),(132,60,'bot','Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal)\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A topical aftercare cream intended for use on small treated areas after procedures such as wart or skin tag removal.\nPurpose: Used after a minor removal procedure to keep the treated area comfortable and moisturised while it heals, following the aftercare advice given by our clinic staff.\nBenefits: Commonly used to support comfort and help keep the treated area conditioned while it heals. Keep the area clean and dry, do not pick at scabs, and protect it from sun exposure.\nPrice: ₱150 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:40.025'),(133,61,'user','body scrub',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:40.090'),(134,61,'bot','Full-body scrubs exfoliate and smooth rough, dry skin for an instant softness and glow.\n\n1) Deluxe Foot Spa (₱599, 70 min)\n2) Deluxe Hand Spa (₱399, 50 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:42.910'),(135,62,'user','gua sha',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:42.958'),(136,62,'bot','Gua sha facial massage relieves tension, boosts circulation, and restores a natural glow.\n\n1) 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299, 60 min)\n2) Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:45.565'),(137,63,'user','glutathione',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:45.635'),(138,63,'bot','Glutathione treatments brighten and even out skin tone for a healthy, luminous glow.\n\n1) Diamond Glow Classic (₱499, 60 min)\n2) Placenta Glow Enhancer (₱1,499, 10 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:48.571'),(139,64,'user','exosome',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:48.630'),(140,64,'bot','Exosome and scalp therapies help regenerate hair, calm the scalp, and support healthy regrowth.\n\n1) PDRN Skin Healing Treatment (₱10,000, 60 min)\n2) PDRN Bio-Repair Infusion + Exosome + DMAE (₱25,000, 180 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:51.475'),(141,65,'user','meso',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:51.523'),(142,65,'bot','Mesotherapy and lipolysis treatments target stubborn pockets of fat for a smoother, sleeker silhouette.\n\n1) L-Carnitine Slim Boost (₱1,199, 10 min)\n2) Alpha Lipoic Acid (ALA) Detox (₱1,399, 10 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:54.311'),(143,66,'user','diamond',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:54.356'),(144,66,'bot','Our diamond-finish treatments — like Diamond Glow and Diamond Peel — brighten, exfoliate, and polish the skin.\n\n1) Diamond Glow Classic (₱499, 60 min)\n2) Signature DermaClear+ Diamond Facial (₱999, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:57.062'),(145,67,'user','what are the available services?',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:09:57.116'),(146,67,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NUL