'bot','Sunscreen SPF50+\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A broad-spectrum sunscreen with SPF 50+, formulated to be applied to the skin before sun exposure and reapplied as directed.\nPurpose: Used to help protect the skin from UVA and UVB radiation, which helps prevent sunburn and reduce the risk of early skin ageing and sun-related skin damage.\nBenefits: Commonly used to help prevent sunburn and protect against sun-related skin ageing when applied as directed. Reapply at least every two hours, and after swimming, sweating or towel drying.\nPrice: ₱1,500 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:08.037'),(211,100,'user','retinol',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:08.091'),(212,100,'bot','Retinol Night Cream\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A night cream containing retinol, a vitamin A derivative widely used in anti-ageing and blemish-prone skincare. It is applied in the evening.\nPurpose: Used overnight to support the skin’s natural cell renewal and to help improve the look of fine lines, uneven texture, dark spots and clogged pores.\nBenefits: Commonly used to smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin texture and tone, and help unclog pores over several weeks of use. Skin can become more sun-sensitive, so daytime sunscreen is important.\nPrice: ₱1,400 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:08.135'),(213,101,'user','botox',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:08.194'),(214,101,'bot','Botox relaxes fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother, fresher look — we also offer dermal fillers and non-injectable lifting options.\n\n1) Signature Botox: Per Unit (₱450, 15 min)\n2) Signature Botox: Perioral (Lip Flip) (₱3,500, 15 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:11.028'),(215,102,'user','peel',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:11.075'),(216,10