low.\n\n1) Diamond Glow Classic (₱499, 60 min)\n2) Placenta Glow Enhancer (₱1,499, 10 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:22.469'),(225,107,'user','exosome',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:22.526'),(226,107,'bot','Exosome and scalp therapies help regenerate hair, calm the scalp, and support healthy regrowth.\n\n1) PDRN Skin Healing Treatment (₱10,000, 60 min)\n2) PDRN Bio-Repair Infusion + Exosome + DMAE (₱25,000, 180 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:25.311'),(227,108,'user','meso',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:25.362'),(228,108,'bot','Mesotherapy and lipolysis treatments target stubborn pockets of fat for a smoother, sleeker silhouette.\n\n1) L-Carnitine Slim Boost (₱1,199, 10 min)\n2) Alpha Lipoic Acid (ALA) Detox (₱1,399, 10 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:28.025'),(229,109,'user','diamond',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:28.083'),(230,109,'bot','Our diamond-finish treatments — like Diamond Glow and Diamond Peel — brighten, exfoliate, and polish the skin.\n\n1) Diamond Glow Classic (₱499, 60 min)\n2) Signature DermaClear+ Diamond Facial (₱999, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:30.761'),(231,110,'user','what are the available services?',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:30.820'),(232,110,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:11:30.