01,145,'user','peel',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:50.833'),(302,145,'bot','Chemical peels exfoliate and renew the skin to fade pigmentation and smooth texture.\n\n1) 7 Sess. - Underarm Diamond Peel w/ Bleach (₱7,134, 60 min)\n2) Underarm Diamond Peel + Carbon Laser Whitening (₱1,499, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:53.497'),(303,146,'user','hair removal',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:53.545'),(304,146,'bot','Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal)\nCategory: Retail Items\nDescription: A topical aftercare cream intended for use on small treated areas after procedures such as wart or skin tag removal.\nPurpose: Used after a minor removal procedure to keep the treated area comfortable and moisturised while it heals, following the aftercare advice given by our clinic staff.\nBenefits: Commonly used to support comfort and help keep the treated area conditioned while it heals. Keep the area clean and dry, do not pick at scabs, and protect it from sun exposure.\nPrice: ₱150 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:53.588'),(305,147,'user','body scrub',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:53.647'),(306,147,'bot','Full-body scrubs exfoliate and smooth rough, dry skin for an instant softness and glow.\n\n1) Deluxe Foot Spa (₱599, 70 min)\n2) Deluxe Hand Spa (₱399, 50 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:56.480'),(307,148,'user','gua sha',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:56.543'),(308,148,'bot','Gua sha facial massage relieves tension, boosts circulation, and restores a natural glow.\n\n1) 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299, 60 min)\n2) Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:59.329'),(309,149,'user','glutathione',NULL,'2026-10-12 11:15:59.399'),(310,149,'bot','Glutathione treatmen