ye. We treat the eye area with tightening HIFU, Rejuran eye boosters, and under-eye brightening programs.\n\n1) Eye Area HIFU (₱2,990, 30 min)\n2) Double Chin HIFU (₱3,290, 45 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.104'),(505,247,'user','what are your hours?',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.155'),(506,247,'bot','Our clinic hours are:\nMonday-Saturday: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM, Sunday: Closed\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.213'),(507,248,'user','services',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.266'),(508,248,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.317'),(509,249,'user','lip pigmentation',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.370'),(510,249,'bot','Permanent makeup gives long-lasting brow, lash-line, and lip color — with professional touch-ups and tattoo removal.\n\n1) Eyebrow Design (₱369, 10 min)\n2) MicroWispy Brows (₱9,199, 90 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.414'),(511,250,'user','permanent makeup',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.463'),(512,250,'bot','Permanent makeup gives long-lasting brow, lash-line, and lip color — with professional touch-ups and tattoo removal.\n\n1) Eyebrow Design (₱369, 10 min)\n2) MicroWispy Brows (₱9,199, 90 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.508'),(513,251,'user','botox',NULL,'2026-10-12 12:55:12.566'),(514,