rmation about our services and treatments\n- Service pricing and packages\n- Our best-selling and recommended services\n- Clinic hours, location, and contact details\n\nWhat would you like to know?',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.563'),(957,473,'user','tell me about your clinic',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.658'),(958,473,'bot','Souvari Skin Lab is a beauty and aesthetics clinic.\n\nLocation: 123 Beauty Ave, Makati City, Metro Manila, Philippines\nPhone: +63 917 123 4567\nHours: Monday-Saturday: 10:00 AM - 8:00 PM, Sunday: Closed\n\nI can help with our services and pricing, treatment recommendations, and how to book. What would you like to know?\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.694'),(959,474,'user','what should I do after a facial',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.775'),(960,474,'bot','I don\'t have specific aftercare instructions for that treatment on file yet, so I don\'t want to guess — aftercare can depend on the exact treatment and your skin.\n\nPlease ask our clinic professionals, who will give you aftercare tailored to your treatment. If you notice anything severe or that is getting worse, please seek medical care right away.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.821'),(961,475,'user','are there contraindications for laser',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.907'),(962,475,'bot','I can share general information about our services, but I\'m not able to give medical advice, confirm whether a treatment is right for you, or promise a result.\n\nFor your safety, please consult our clinic professionals — you can start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" and mention this so they can advise you properly. If your symptoms are severe or getting worse, please seek medical care right away.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 09:30:36.948'),(963,476,'user','can I get botox while pregnant',NULL,'2026-10-13 09: