ny questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:25.375'),(1075,532,'user','acne',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.514'),(1076,532,'bot','Acne Treatment Cream\nCategory: Skincare Products\nDescription: An over-the-counter topical cream formulated to help treat mild to moderate acne and blemishes. It is applied directly to the affected areas as part of a daily skincare routine.\nPurpose: Used to help clear up acne pimples and blemishes and to help prevent new ones from forming, by reducing acne-causing bacteria and helping to unclog pores.\nBenefits: Commonly used to reduce the number and appearance of pimples and blemishes, calm inflammation, and support clearer-looking skin with consistent use. Results typically take several weeks.\nPrice: ₱1,200 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.565'),(1077,533,'user','dryness',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.646'),(1078,533,'bot','For dry, dull and dehydrated skin, here are my top picks:\n\n- Diamond Glow Classic (₱499, 60 min) — Ideal for dry, dull and dehydrated skin\n- 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299, 60 min) — Ideal for dry, dull and dehydrated skin\n- Rejuran HB (Hydro Booster) (₱25,000, 60 min) — Ideal for dry, dull and dehydrated skin\n\nWant details on any of these? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.704'),(1079,534,'user','what are your hours',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.788'),(1080,534,'bot','Our clinic hours are:\nMonday-Saturday: 10:00 AM - 8:00 PM, Sunday: Closed\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.832'),(1081,535,'user','where are you located',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.901'),(1082,535,'bot','Contact Information:\nPhone: +63 917 123 4567\nAddress: 123 Beauty Ave, Makati City, Metro Manila, Philippines\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:36.938'),(1083,536,'user','how much is a facial',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.043'),(1084,536,'bot','Facials are custom, glow-boosting treatments — from classic cleansing and anti-aging to hydra and diamond finishes.\n\n1) 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299, 60 min)\n2) Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799, 60 min)\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.083'),(1085,537,'user','help',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.163'),(1086,537,'bot','I can help you with:\n- Information about our services and treatments\n- Service pricing and packages\n- Our best-selling and recommended services\n- Clinic hours, location, and contact details\n\nWhat would you like to know?',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.192'),(1087,538,'user','tell me about your clinic',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.263'),(1088,538,'bot','Souvari Skin Lab is a beauty and aesthetics clinic.\n\nLocation: 123 Beauty Ave, Makati City, Metro Manila, Philippines\nPhone: +63 917 123 4567\nHours: Monday-Saturday: 10:00 AM - 8:00 PM, Sunday: Closed\n\nI can help with our services and pricing, treatment recommendations, and how to book. What would you like to know?\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.294'),(1089,539,'user','what should I do after a facial',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.363'),(1090,539,'bot','I don\'t have specific aftercare instructions for that treatment on file yet, so I don\'t want to guess — aftercare can depend on the exact treatment and your skin.\n\nPlease ask our clinic professionals, who will give you aftercare tailored to your treatment. If you notice anything severe or that is getting worse, please seek medical care right away.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.400'),(1091,540,'user','can I get botox while pregnant',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.477'),(1092,540,'bot','I can share general information about our services, but I\'m not able to give medical advice, confirm whether a treatment is right for you, or promise a result.\n\nFor your safety, please consult our clinic professionals — you can start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" and mention this so they can advise you properly. If your symptoms are severe or getting worse, please seek medical care right away.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.509'),(1093,541,'user','I can\'t breathe',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.579'),(1094,541,'bot','If this may be a medical emergency, please call 911 or your local emergency number right away, or go to the nearest emergency room.\n\nCommon warning signs include difficulty breathing, swelling of the face, lips, tongue, or throat, chest pain, fainting, or severe bleeding. For anything non-urgent, please contact the clinic directly to speak with our professionals.',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.611'),(1095,542,'user','spaghetti recipe',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.686'),(1096,542,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-13 11:58:37.730'),(1097,543,'user','what are available products?',NULL,'2026-10-13 23:36:33.829'),(1098,543,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-13 23:36:34.012'),(1099,544,'user','what are available products?',NULL,'2026-10-14 06:31:55.393'),(1100,544,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-14 06:31:55.450'),(1101,545,'user','oily skin',NULL,'2026-10-14 11:59:38.564'),(1102,545,'bot','For oily skin, we recommend treatments that focus on deep cleansing and oil control. Our top options are: 1) Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799) to purify pores; 2) Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (₱1,499) to manage excess oil and refine texture.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. You may also book our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to have our experts assess your skin and build a plan tailored to your needs.',NULL,'2026-10-14 11:59:40.722'),(1103,546,'user','what are available products?',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:02:47.998'),(1104,546,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:02:48.146'),(1105,547,'user','Products',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:04:58.743'),(1106,547,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:04:58.792'),(1107,548,'user','Acne',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:05.946'),(1108,548,'bot','For acne and breakouts, we offer the following treatments:\n\n1) Mild Acne Treatment w/ Mask (₱1,249): A facial focusing on cleansing and soothing irritated skin.\n2) Severe Acne Treatment + Mask (₱1,549): A more intensive 75-minute treatment for persistent breakouts.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. You can start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to have your skin assessed before committing to a treatment.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:10.049'),(1109,549,'user','what are available products?',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:15.303'),(1110,549,'bot','We currently carry these 11 products:\n- Acne Treatment Cream (₱1,200)\n- Aloe Vera Gel (₱500)\n- Bump Eraiser (Aftercare for Hot Waxing) (₱250)\n- Collagen Face Mask (10-pack) (₱2,000)\n- Facial Cleansing Gel (₱850)\n- Hydrating Serum (₱1,800)\n- Jade Roller Set (₱1,200)\n- Post Healing Cream (Aftercare for Warts/Skin Tag Removal) (₱150)\n- Retinol Night Cream (₱1,400)\n- Sunscreen SPF50+ (₱1,500)\n- Vitamin C Serum (₱1,600)\n\nAsk me about any one of them for details.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:15.340'),(1111,550,'user','Oily Skin',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:15.687'),(1112,550,'bot','For oily skin, managing excess sebum and deep cleaning the pores is key. Here are two great options:\n\n1. Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799) – A deep-cleansing facial designed to clear congestion and balance oil levels.\n2. Hollywood Carbon Laser Peel (₱1,499) – Excellent for minimizing oil production and refining skin texture.\n\nWould you like more details on these, or would you prefer to book our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to have our professionals assess your skin? Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:19.001'),(1113,551,'user','Dry Skin',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:24.774'),(1114,551,'bot','For dry skin, we offer treatments that focus on deep hydration and restoring your skin\'s moisture barrier:\n\n1. 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299): Provides deep cleansing and hydration to refresh dull, dry skin.\n2. Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799): A gentle facial designed to cleanse while maintaining your skin\'s natural moisture.\n\nI recommend booking our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" so our professionals can assess your skin and build a personalized plan for you. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:27.598'),(1115,552,'user','I have weak nails',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:33.459'),(1116,552,'bot','For nail care and strengthening, we offer services like Soft BIAB (Builder in a Bottle) at ₱799, which is designed to add strength to natural nails. We also have a Signature Manicure for ₱129 if you prefer a classic clean-up. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice on your nail health.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:05:36.680'),(1117,553,'user','What is Soft BIAB',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:06:01.354'),(1118,553,'bot','Soft BIAB (Builder In A Bottle) is a strengthening gel treatment designed to provide a durable, natural-looking overlay for your nails. It is a great option for those looking to add structure and protection to their natural nails.\n\nWe offer:\n• Soft BIAB (Full Set): ₱799 (60 minutes).\n• Soft BIAB Removal (Souvari Work): ₱350 (20 minutes).\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:06:04.006'),(1119,554,'user','What are your services?',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:17:26.457'),(1120,554,'bot','We cover facials, laser and skin rejuvenation, hair removal, body treatments, injectables, consultations, and nail/spa care.\n\nCould you tell me your main skin concern or goal — for example acne, dark spots, wrinkles, dryness, or whitening — and whether it is for your face or body? Or you can just name a category and I will show you its top services.\n\nYou can also start with our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" — available to new and returning clients — and our professionals will build the right plan for you.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:17:26.510'),(1121,555,'user','Facials',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:17:30.131'),(1122,555,'bot','We offer a variety of facials to address different skin needs, ranging from deep cleansing to anti-aging. Here are three popular options:\n\n1. Diamond Glow Classic (₱499): A great entry-level facial for general skin rejuvenation.\n2. Signature DermaClear Facial (₱799): Focuses on deep cleansing and clarifying the skin.\n3. 10 in 1 HydraFacial (₱1,299): A comprehensive treatment for a refreshed and hydrated glow.\n\nWould you like more details on any of these? You can also book our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to have our professionals assess your skin and build a personalized plan for you. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:17:33.083'),(1123,556,'user','wax',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:18:35.941'),(1124,556,'bot','We offer a variety of waxing services for both the face and body to help you achieve smooth skin. For example, we provide Underarm waxing for ₱439 or a full Brazilian wax for ₱1,119. \n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice, and feel free to book our free \"Free Skin Consultation\" to discuss which service is best for your needs.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:18:39.346'),(1125,557,'user','Microblading',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:16.394'),(1126,557,'bot','We offer 6Ds Microblading for ₱7,299, which is a 90-minute procedure to enhance your brows. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice to see if this is the right fit for you. You can also book a free \"Free Skin Consultation\" to discuss your beauty goals.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:19.697'),(1127,558,'user','Aloe Vera',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:29.490'),(1128,558,'bot','Aloe Vera Gel\nCategory: Skincare Products\nDescription: A soothing topical gel made with aloe vera, known for its high water content and calming, moisturising properties on the skin.\nPurpose: Used to hydrate and soothe dry, irritated or sun-exposed skin, and to support the skin’s natural recovery after minor irritation.\nBenefits: Commonly used to moisturise the skin, help calm redness and irritation, and support skin comfort and hydration.\nPrice: ₱500 per bottle\nAvailability: In stock\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice.',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:29.523'),(1129,559,'user','Birthday',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:38.015'),(1130,559,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:38.047'),(1131,560,'user','Handa mo',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:41.694'),(1132,560,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:19:41.725'),(1133,561,'user','Souvari',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:20:36.459'),(1134,561,'bot','Welcome to Souvari Skin Lab! We are located at 123 Beauty Ave, Makati City, and are open Monday–Saturday, 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM. You can reach us at +63 917 123 4567 for inquiries or to book an appointment. How can I assist you with our services today?',NULL,'2026-10-15 10:20:39.458'),(1135,562,'user','Tae',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:46:40.780'),(1136,562,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:46:40.817'),(1137,563,'user','Butt',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:46:48.206'),(1138,563,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:46:48.235'),(1139,564,'user','Botox',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:46:53.440'),(1140,564,'bot','We offer various Botox treatments to help with facial rejuvenation and slimming. Popular options include:\n• Signature Botox: Jawline Slimming (Masseter): ₱12,500 – targets the jaw muscles for a slimmer look.\n• Signature Botox: Frontalis (Forehead): ₱4,950 – helps smooth the forehead area.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. You can also book a free \"Free Skin Consultation\" to discuss the best approach for your specific goals.',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:47:11.515'),(1141,565,'user','Botox',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:47:18.031'),(1142,565,'bot','We offer several Botox treatments to address specific areas. Here are a few options:\n• Signature Botox: Jawline Slimming (Masseter) – ₱12,500 (15 minutes) for facial contouring.\n• Signature Botox: Frontalis (Forehead) – ₱4,950 (15 minutes) to help smooth the forehead area.\n\nPlease consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. You can also book a FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to discuss your goals with our team.',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:47:36.803'),(1143,566,'user','Tirzepitide',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:12.480'),(1144,566,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:12.509'),(1145,567,'user','Weight',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:19.882'),(1146,567,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:19.916'),(1147,568,'user','Weight loss',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:25.566'),(1148,568,'bot','For weight loss and body contouring, we offer: 1) Metabolic Optimization (Tirzepatide) at ₱4,500 for a single session; 2) Slim Point Premier Lipolysis starting at ₱9,990 for targeted fat reduction; 3) 7 Sessions Abdomen Contouring package for ₱15,000. Please consult with our clinic professionals for personalized advice. You may also book our FREE \"Free Skin Consultation\" to discuss your goals with our team.',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:48:27.272'),(1149,569,'user','Does 7 sessions included in the 15,000',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:49:37.494'),(1150,569,'bot','I\'m here to answer questions about Souvari Skin Lab — our services, pricing, clinic hours, and location. That question is outside what I can help with. If you have any questions about our treatments or pricing, feel free to ask!',NULL,'2026-10-15 13:49:37.518');
